{"translation":{"id":"cmn_feb","name":"免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible","website":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseUrl":"https://ebible.org/Scriptures/details.php?id=cmnfeb","licenseNotes":null,"shortName":"FEB","englishName":"Chinese, Mandarin: 免费的易读圣经 Free Easy-to-read Bible (Bible)","language":"cmn","textDirection":"ltr","sha256":"281f45e9c6d64d9cf8e618e4fd7d2d961bebba0f46a534312de0f8ea52a83755","availableFormats":["json"],"listOfBooksApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/books.json","numberOfBooks":27,"totalNumberOfChapters":260,"totalNumberOfVerses":7959,"languageName":"中文","languageEnglishName":"Chinese"},"book":{"id":"REV","translationId":"cmn_feb","name":"启示录","commonName":"启示录","title":"启示录","order":66,"numberOfChapters":22,"sha256":"1b0315a3d5fb9bc58371677cd24bae3a1e83b3ad82faf7987ee2a56ef5c58c4d","firstChapterNumber":1,"firstChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/REV/1.json","lastChapterNumber":22,"lastChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/REV/22.json","totalNumberOfVerses":405},"chapter":{"number":10,"content":[{"type":"verse","number":1,"content":["我又看见一位力量强大的天使从天上而降，身披云彩，头上有彩虹，脸像太阳，两脚如火柱。"]},{"type":"verse","number":2,"content":["他手里拿着展开的小书卷，将右脚踏在海上，左脚踏在地上，"]},{"type":"verse","number":3,"content":["他如狮子般大声呼叫。在呼喊的时候，有七个惊雷回应它。"]},{"type":"verse","number":4,"content":["七声惊雷响起时，我正要写下来，就听见天上传来一个声音说：“你要封印七雷所说的，不要写出来！”"]},{"type":"verse","number":5,"content":["我看见那天使站在海上和地上，向天举起右手。"]},{"type":"verse","number":6,"content":["他凭着那创造天和天中万物、地和地中万物、海和海中万物，永生永世的主发了一个神圣的誓言。说：“不能再耽搁了！"]},{"type":"verse","number":7,"content":["但当第七位天使说话并吹响号角时，上帝的奥秘",{"noteId":41},"、他向其仆人和众先知们宣布的福音就要实现了。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":8,"content":["然后我再次听到那天上传来的声音对我说：“去吧，去那站在海上和地上天使处，将他手中展开的书卷拿过来。”"]},{"type":"verse","number":9,"content":["我走到天使那里，请他把小书卷给我。他对我说：“拿着吧，吃下去。它会让你的肠胃发酸，但是口里却好像蜜一样甘甜。”",{"noteId":42}]},{"type":"verse","number":10,"content":["我把小书卷从天使手中拿过来，吃下去，口里甘甜如蜜，但吃下去却感觉肠胃发酸。"]},{"type":"verse","number":11,"content":["他又对我说：“关于众多民族、国家、语言和君王，你必须再次做出预言。”"]}],"footnotes":[{"noteId":41,"caller":"+","text":"同样，这也是一个“揭秘”的过程。换言之，“上帝的神秘计划将会实现。”","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":7}},{"noteId":42,"caller":"+","text":"参考《民数记》 5:24 和《以西结书》 3:3","reference":{"chapter":10,"verse":9}}]},"thisChapterLink":"/api/cmn_feb/REV/10.json","thisChapterAudioLinks":{},"nextChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/REV/11.json","nextChapterAudioLinks":{},"previousChapterApiLink":"/api/cmn_feb/REV/9.json","previousChapterAudioLinks":{},"numberOfVerses":11}